    "declared": {
      "summary": "Implement and qualify a generic versioned unbiased bounded integer transformation for SplitMix64, including exact counter, budget and checkpoint behavior.",
      "value": "Add two bounded methods to the existing noncryptographic SplitMix64Random, preserving raw generator vectors, and target independent exhaustive 8-bit rejection proof, forced raw-word rejection, output boundaries, signed extremes, typed invalid-input and counter refusals, replay and existing statistics regressions. Do not pack or publish.",
